  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RY-IDF Capacity Building on Legal Aspects of WTO Accession (TF094514)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capacity of Yemen Ministry of Legal AFfairs on  handling of legal aspects of Yemen accession to the WTO. The objective of the Project is to strengthen Yemen&apos;s capacity to address the legal aspects of accession to the World Trade Organization (WTO). This will be achieved through enhancing the institutional capacity of Yemen&apos;s Ministry of Legal Affairs (MLA) to effectively provide the legal services needed for pre- and post-WTO accession including: (i) undertaking the necessary revisions to Yemen&apos;s legislation and legal framework for accession to the WTO; and (ii) negotiating international trade treaties; and (iii) addressing legal issues arising from Yemen&apos;s WTO commitments post-accession, such as international trade disputes.</narrative>
  </description>
